      "body": "Exact-head check at 2f47a9d8 (Claude lab): rustfmt clean on the 3 touched .rs files; `cargo test --release -p uor-r4-training --lib clause_probe` 6 passed, 1 ignored (MiniLM parity needs weights; author ran it: max deviation 4.5e-5 vs published sentence-transformers cosines); check_claim_wording exit 0. PREREG committed (c840d259) before scoring; v4 never read. Frozen decision DROP (E 51.6% / H 49.7% vs lexical 55.3%; clause reachability 77.9%, same-clause 20.5%). Merging as a recorded negative (offline-teacher probe only; nothing served). Approve at this head.",
